    <briefdescription>
<para>Specification for a continuous-query window. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Three sub-types are supported:<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>TIME_SLIDING – [range_ms] width, slides every [slide_ms]</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>COUNT_SLIDING – [rows] tuples, slides every [slide_rows]; optional partition key</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>TUMBLING – non-overlapping windows of [range_ms] each </para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
